OL,3,CGirlguides uniform redesigned for the
OL,4,Cfirst time in more than 30 years
OL,6,FGirlguiding has announced a change in
OL,7,Fits unform for the first time in more
OL,8,Fthan 30 years, to give girls the
OL,9,F"freedom to express themselves".
OL,11,FThe redesign means Guides now only
OL,12,Fhave to wear one of the new tops to be
OL,13,Fclassed as being "in uniform".
OL,15,FGirlguiding said they collaborated
OL,16,Fwith thousands of girls and young
OL,17,Fwomen from Guides, Rainbows, Brownies
OL,18,Fand Rangers to come up with the new
OL,19,Funiform.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
