OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785178109
OL,3,CGirlguides uniform redesigned for the
OL,4,Cfirst time in more than 30 years
OL,6,FChief executive Felicity Oswald said
OL,7,Fthe policy change aims to give Guides
OL,8,Fthe "freedom to express themselves,
OL,9,Fwhilst feeling part of our amazing
OL,10,Forganisation".
OL,12,FShe said it "empowers girls and
OL,13,Fvolunteers to embrace their
OL,14,Findividuality," and the designs focus
OL,15,Fon "practicality, comfort and
OL,16,Fsustainability".
OL,18,FThe uniform, by by HemmingwayDesign,
OL,19,Fis an update to the 1990 design and is
OL,20,Fmade up of 30 garments and 15
OL,21,Faccessories and neckerchiefs in total.
