OL,3,CGirlguides uniform redesigned for the
OL,4,Cfirst time in more than 30 years
OL,6,FThe clothing includes bold colours,
OL,7,Fcross-body bag badge sashes and secret
OL,8,Fpockets.
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FGirlguiding surveyed 2,000 girls aged
OL,16,Fsix to 16 in the UK in June, and 93%
OL,17,Fsaid they feel most comfortable when
OL,18,Fthey can choose how to style
OL,19,Fthemselves.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
