OL,3,CGirlguides uniform redesigned for the
OL,4,Cfirst time in more than 30 years
OL,6,FIts launch comes six weeks before a
OL,7,Fchange in the Girlguiding membership
OL,8,Fcomes into force when transgender
OL,9,Fgirls will be asked to leave the
OL,10,Forganisation.
OL,12,FFollowing the 2025 Supreme Court
OL,13,Fruling on biological sex, in December
OL,14,Fit was announced that girlguiding
OL,15,Fmembership would be limited to "girls
OL,16,Fand young women".
OL,18,FSome Girlguides protested and
OL,19,Fthreatened to leave, however others
OL,20,Fagreed with the decision due to
OL,21,Fconcerns over safeguarding.
