OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785178109
OL,3,CGirlguides uniform redesigned for the
OL,4,Cfirst time in more than 30 years
OL,6,FThere are currently about 300,000
OL,7,Fpeople aged from four to 18 across the
OL,8,Ffour groups within Girlguiding
OL,9,F(Guides, Rainbows, Brownies and
OL,10,FRangers), as well as around 80,000
OL,11,Fvolunteers.
OL,13,FGirlguiding has said in the past that
OL,14,Fthey do not collect information on
OL,15,Fmembers' gender identity so are unable
OL,16,Fto say how many people are impacted by
OL,17,Fthe change in rules.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
